On Tue, Feb 15, 2005 at 11:30:39PM -0000, Matt Simis wrote:
> Wondering how exactly one starts expert mode and or pass the "linux26"=20
> command (Kernel 2.6) for the Alpha Net Installer. I need to do this as I=
=20
> want to boot from a IDE drive but install on a SATA drive on a DP264 (SRM=
)=20

There are no 2.6 kernels available for the current version of
